Hi, everyone. I have one quesition about missing value in response or outcome. Right now my real data (response) has some missing values, and I directly use it to a cognitive diagnosis model. But I always have: logProb is -Inf. I am wondeing if there is any trick about this? Could I just use NA in the outcome? THanks!

